    title: "評測 HP Z4 G6i 工作站：搭載 Intel Xeon 600 系列處理器，適用於多種 Linux 工作負載",
    summary: "本文對 HP Z4 G6i 工作站進行了為期一個月的全面性能測試，該工作站採用 Intel Xeon 600 系列處理器（如 Xeon 678X）和 NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 顯示卡。雖然預設作業系統為 Windows 11 Pro，但它對 Ubuntu LTS 等 Linux 發行版支援良好，並被認為「Linux 友善」。測試涵蓋了多種工作負載，包括不同版本的 Linux 核心（如 Linux 7.1、7.2、7.3）性能比較、Intel AMX 性能、Btrfs 等檔案系統的基準測試，以及 PHP 版本的性能評估。在所有測試中，該工作站表現穩定，兼容了 Ubuntu 26.04 LTS、Fedora Workstation 44 等多種 Linux 發行版。文章建議使用者應使用官方 NVIDIA Linux 驅動堆疊，而非 Nouveau/NVK，以獲得最佳性能。",
    tags: ["HP Z4 G6i", "Intel Xeon 600 Series", "Linux", "Ubuntu", "NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell", "工作站"],
    title_en: "Reviewing the HP Z4 G6i Workstation: Equipped with Intel Xeon 600 Series Processors, Suitable for Various Linux Workloads",
    summary_en: "This article provides a comprehensive month-long performance test of the HP Z4 G6i workstation. The workstation utilizes Intel Xeon 600 Series processors (such as Xeon 678X) and the NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell graphics card. Although the default operating system is Windows 11 Pro, it shows excellent support for Linux distributions like Ubuntu LTS and is considered 'Linux-friendly.' The tests covered various workloads, including performance comparisons across different Linux kernels (such as Linux 7.1, 7.2, and 7.3), Intel AMX performance, benchmarks for file systems like Btrfs, and performance evaluations for various PHP versions. In all tests, the workstation performed stably and was compatible with multiple Linux distributions, including Ubuntu 26.04 LTS and Fedora Workstation 44. The article recommends that users utilize the official NVIDIA Linux driver stack rather than Nouveau/NVK to achieve optimal performance.",
    tags_en: ["HP Z4 G6i", "Intel Xeon 600 Series", "Linux", "Ubuntu", "NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell", "Workstation"],
