    title: "Apple M6 晶片重大升級：基礎型Mac mini首次搭載三種核心架構",
    summary: "Apple 在新一代 M6 晶片上進行了重大升級，使其基礎型 Mac mini 首次具備了三種不同核心架構：Super cores（超級核心）、Performance cores（效能核心）和 Efficiency cores（效率核心）。過去，Apple 的基礎晶片通常只有兩種核心類型。M6 晶片總共提供 12 個核心，包括 2 個 Super cores、4 個 Performance cores 和 6 個 Efficiency cores。Super cores 是 Apple 最強大的 CPU 核心，而 Performance cores 則屬於中階，旨在平衡性能與能效。此變動使得原本只有高階晶片（如 M5 Pro 和 M5 Max）才具備的雙核心配置，現在也普及到基礎型 M6 晶片上，顯著提升了基礎型 Mac 的性能上限。這代表 Apple 在晶片設計上持續朝向更複雜、更全面的核心配置發展，為用戶帶來更具吸引力的入門級升級體驗。",
    tags: ["Apple", "M6", "Mac mini", "CPU 核心", "Super cores", "Performance cores"],
    title_en: "Major Upgrade to Apple M6 Chip: Base Mac mini Features Three Core Architectures for the First Time",
    summary_en: "Apple has made a significant upgrade to the new M6 chip, enabling the base Mac mini to feature three distinct core architectures for the first time: Super cores, Performance cores, and Efficiency cores. Previously, Apple's base chips typically only featured two core types. The M6 chip provides a total of 12 cores, including 2 Super cores, 4 Performance cores, and 6 Efficiency cores. Super cores are Apple's most powerful CPU cores, while Performance cores are considered mid-tier, designed to balance performance and efficiency. This change means that the dual-core configuration, previously exclusive to high-end chips (such as the M5 Pro and M5 Max), is now also available on the base M6 chip, significantly raising the performance ceiling of the base Mac. This indicates Apple's continued development toward more complex and comprehensive core configurations in its chip design, offering users a more appealing entry-level upgrade experience.",
