    summary_en: "This article is a technology prediction piece, previewing multiple new product lines Apple may launch this autumn (September) and beyond. Key product lines include: Flagship phones are expected to be the iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max, alongside the debut of a foldable iPhone Ultra. For wearables, updates are anticipated for AirPods 5, Apple Watch Ultra 4, and Apple Watch Series 12, the latter expected to upgrade to an S-class chip and enhanced health features. The Mac lineup is expected to introduce high-end models such as the MacBook Ultra and M6 MacBook Pro. For tablets, there will be an OLED iPad mini and a base iPad supporting Apple Intelligence. Furthermore, the Apple Home product line is set to expand, including upgraded Apple TV 4K, HomePod, and HomePod 3, with the development of these products closely tied to Siri AI integration. The article provides no specific vulnerabilities or security information; it is purely a product launch prediction.",
