    id: "20260828-053",
    trackers: ["os", "security"],
    category: "Android",
    title: "wallabag Android 應用程式透過 WebView 載入資料，存在 XSS 跨站腳本攻擊漏洞",
    summary: "wallabag 應用程式（版本 2.6.0 及以下）在 Android 平台上存在一個跨站腳本（XSS）漏洞。此漏洞的根源在於應用程式將 `/api/entries` 的資料內容載入到 WebView 元件中，而未進行適當的資料淨化或輸出編碼處理。攻擊者可利用此缺陷，透過注入惡意的腳本，在受害用戶的 WebView 介面中執行任意 JavaScript，從而可能竊取用戶的會話資訊、執行惡意操作，或進行資料篡改。建議使用者應立即更新 wallabag 應用程式至修復版本，或考慮使用其他安全可靠的閱讀器替代方案，以降低風險。本漏洞的具體 CVSS 分數及影響範圍資訊未在原文中提供。",
    tags: ["wallabag", "Android", "XSS", "WebView", "CVE-2026-82089"],
    title_en: "wallabag Android App Vulnerable to XSS Cross-Site Scripting via WebView Data Loading",
    summary_en: "The wallabag application (versions 2.6.0 and earlier) contains a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability on the Android platform. The root cause is that the application loads data from the `/api/entries` endpoint into a WebView component without proper data sanitization or output encoding. An attacker can exploit this flaw by injecting malicious scripts to execute arbitrary JavaScript within the victim user's WebView interface, potentially leading to the theft of user session information, execution of malicious actions, or data tampering. Users are advised to immediately update the wallabag application to a patched version or consider using alternative, secure reading applications to mitigate the risk. Specific CVSS scores and impact scope information were not provided in the original text.",
    tags_en: ["wallabag", "Android", "XSS", "WebView", "CVE-2026-82089"],
    sources: [
      { name: "NVD CVE API", url: "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-82089", lang: "EN" }
    ]
