    title: "Microsoft Teams Facilitator AI 助理功能延期至 11 月，具備即時知識檢測與問答能力",
    summary: "Microsoft 的 Teams Facilitator 是一個 AI 助理，旨在加入會議並協助記錄議程與筆記。其進階功能是能夠即時偵測會議中的知識缺口，並主動彈出提示來提供答案或資訊。該功能被認為是類似於早期的 Clippy 輔助工具。原先預計於今年 6 月推出，後續多次延期，最新更新將其定於 11 月進行目標版本發布，並於 12 月中旬在全球範圍內正式上線。該功能需要透過 Microsoft 365 Copilot 的高級版本才能使用，且其運作機制涉及即時處理會議對話以生成回應，因此涉及額外的資料處理和 AI 能力。雖然文章未明確說明延期原因，但可能與判斷對話停頓是否構成需要回答的知識缺口，或搜尋結果是否能符合會議語境的複雜性有關。用戶需注意，此功能具備隱私相關考量，但若移除助理，則可停止其行為。",
    tags: ["Microsoft Teams", "Facilitator", "AI 助理", "Microsoft 365 Copilot", "AI 應用", "會議協作"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Teams Facilitator AI Assistant Feature Delayed to November, Offering Real-Time Knowledge Detection and Q&A Capabilities",
    summary_en: "Microsoft's Teams Facilitator is an AI assistant designed to join meetings and help record agendas and notes. Its advanced function is the ability to detect knowledge gaps in real-time during a meeting and proactively pop up suggestions or information. This feature is considered similar to the early Clippy assistant tool. Originally scheduled for release in June of this year, it has been postponed several times. The latest update sets the target version release for November, with a global official launch planned for mid-December. The feature requires an advanced version of Microsoft 365 Copilot to use, and because its mechanism involves real-time processing of meeting dialogue to generate responses, it involves additional data processing and AI capabilities. Although the article does not explicitly state the reason for the delay, it may be related to the complexity of determining whether a dialogue pause constitutes a knowledge gap requiring an answer, or whether search results align with the meeting context. Users should note that this feature has privacy considerations, but its behavior can be stopped by removing the assistant.",
