    category: "重點關注",
    title: "PaperCut 產品面臨零日攻擊：網頁介面漏洞可能允許深度網路存取",
    summary: "印表機管理軟體 PaperCut 的產品（PaperCut NG 和 PaperCut MF）被發現存在一項漏洞。該漏洞存在於產品的網頁介面，可能允許攻擊者透過外部網路存取到用戶內部網路的深層區域。公司已發布緊急安全公告，確認有客戶發生相關事件，並指出入侵指標包括日誌檔案被竄改、以及來自入侵偵測系統、端點安全工具和網路監控套件的警報。雖然 PaperCut 提供了緊急修補程式，但該修補程式並非官方正式發布，且建議用戶的最佳緩解措施是將 PaperCut 伺服器的網頁介面從公共網際網路移除，僅允許來自可信的內部 IP 位址存取。由於這是零日攻擊，公司目前正積極尋求更完善的修復方案，並建議用戶盡快採取行動，例如離線或應用緊急補丁。",
    tags: ["PaperCut", "零日攻擊", "PaperCut NG", "PaperCut MF", "網路安全", "網頁介面"],
    title_en: "PaperCut Products Face Zero-Day Attack: Web Interface Vulnerability May Allow Deep Network Access",
    summary_en: "A vulnerability has been discovered in PaperCut's printing management software products (PaperCut NG and PaperCut MF). The flaw resides in the product's web interface and could potentially allow an attacker to access deep areas of a user's internal network via the external internet. The company has issued an emergency security advisory, confirming that clients have experienced related incidents, and noting indicators of compromise include log file tampering, as well as alerts from intrusion detection systems, endpoint security tools, and network monitoring suites. Although PaperCut has provided an emergency patch, it is not an official release, and the best mitigation measure recommended for users is to remove the PaperCut server's web interface from the public internet, restricting access only to trusted internal IP addresses. Because this is a zero-day attack, the company is actively seeking a more comprehensive fix and advises users to take immediate action, such as going offline or applying the emergency patch.",
    tags_en: ["PaperCut", "Zero-Day Attack", "PaperCut NG", "PaperCut MF", "Cybersecurity", "Web Interface"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/security/2026/08/28/print-management-outfit-papercut-is-under-0-day-attack-and-its-drawing-customers-blood/5293168", lang: "EN" }
    ]
